# TaskDetail.workbench-link-routing.playwright.test.js

## 意图

验证 `GET .../cloud/compute/workbench-link/?task_id=` 经 taskCloudService 原生实现，不得再返回 501 `compute action not yet ported`。

## 前置

- 已登录网关 Token
- 默认 `PLAYWRIGHT_TASK_ID=task_12590983282794675865`（已有 aliyun 实例配置时可断言 200 + workbench_url）

## 断言

- HTTP 非 501，body 不含路由缺失文案
- 200 时：`workbench_url` 含 `ecs-workbench.aliyun.com`，`instance_id`/`region` 非空
- 404 时：无配置场景可接受

## 运行

```bash
PLAYWRIGHT_SITE_ORIGIN=http://183.250.1.132:4000 \
PLAYWRIGHT_GATEWAY_ORIGIN=http://183.250.1.132:18081 \
npx playwright test tests/TaskDetail.workbench-link-routing.playwright.test.js \
  --config=playwright.config.chromium.js
```

## 回归点

- `compute_handlers.go` 须注册 `compute/workbench-link` 路由
- 阿里云 Workbench URL 构建与 Django `get_workbench_link` 语义一致
